 clean replacement for the flagged exp4022 + the 0-task exp4037): exp4012 =
 gemma-4-12B best-of-N k=8 = 0.2581 coverage (no lift). exp4037 launched 31B
 DENSE but scored 0 tasks (too slow). THIS uses Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (MoE, ~3B
